# Build context for agents/agent-history/Dockerfile, agents/document-pipeline/Dockerfile, agents/audio-snippets/Dockerfile and agents/advocate/Dockerfile is the repo root.
# node_modules is the entry that matters. A copy installed on the host carries host-specific pnpm links, and COPY would lay it over
# the image's own install. The image installs its own from the lockfile.
# Env files are ignored at any depth: a key left in a .env anywhere in the tree must never reach the build context.
# The model files a developer fetched into agents/audio-snippets/.models (about 150 MB) stay out too: the image fetches its own at build time.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.models
**/__pycache__
.git
.github
.superpowers
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.log
dist
build
docs
specs
deploy
scripts
